# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository itself, regardless of
# which OS commits a file, and check out as LF on every platform. Without
# this, line endings depend on each collaborator's global core.autocrlf
# (Windows commonly defaults to true, Linux/macOS to input/false) - the
# classic source of "every line shows as changed" diffs and, worse, a
# CRLF-after-shebang breaking a shell script's execution on Linux/macOS.
# Added before the first commit specifically so history starts clean.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Assets that should never go through line-ending normalization.
*.wasm binary
*.ifc binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
